# corsair-xeneon-edge-linux
===
 Native Linux control for the CORSAIR XENEON EDGE 14.5 inch LCD touchscreen. No iCUE, no Windows. DDC/CI picture control, reverse-engineered HID access, and a full touchscreen experience (calibration, independent pointer, ripple indicator). Qt6, GPL-3.0.
